              "id": "226d2e6f-56d6-4d73-8a6a-48e4923ce288",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<em><strong>Quest for Excitement: Sport &amp; Leisure in the Civilizing Process </strong></em>was written by Norbert Elias &amp; Eric Dunning, published by Basil Blackwell, January 1, 1986."
            },
            {
              "id": "08936100-8577-4554-88e6-483e68895c1e",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "e672255f-11ff-4466-9456-610a557d1004",
              "type": "quote",
              "html": "<em>Discusses classical Greek wrestling, the English foxhunt, medieval ball games, and modern soccer, and examines the psychological, sociological, and biological aspects of sports.</em>"
